WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.450
Cells with the same DNA specialise: each shape suits its job.

2
00:00:05.175 --> 00:00:09.325
Same DNA, different jobs: each cell's shape suits its job.

3
00:00:12.326 --> 00:00:16.551
A red blood cell has no nucleus, leaving room for haemoglobin.

4
00:00:19.485 --> 00:00:23.160
A nerve cell's long axon carries signals a long way.
